<title>USA: Integrated says acquires Arcadia Services.</title>
<headline>Integrated says acquires Arcadia Services.</headline>
<dateline>OWINGS MILLS, Md. 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Integrated Health Services Inc  said Friday it signed a definitive merger agreement with privately-held  Arcadia Services Inc.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Arcadia Services,located in Southfield, Michigan, provides home health  care in 16 states through company owned agencies concentrated in Michigan,  Indiana, Ohio, and a network of affiliated agencies throughout the  country. Its annual revenues total approximately $70 million.</p>
</text>
